(7495150, 1193411, 109227, '<td valign="top">I think this is wonderful and received one of my higher scores.</td>', 'I think this is wonderful and received one of my higher scores.', '2017-01-27 08:30:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7495151, 1193851, 109227, '<td valign="top">I think you did a great job Susan.  IMHO, I don''t think the score had anything to do with nudity.  I think it really boils down to strategic voting in the last hours and my score started and ended the same way.  It happens to me all the time.  Use it as a learning tool and go on to the  next.  When you are first learning to mask and do composites, it seems much harder than it will eventually become.  It has been that way for me, and I am still learning new stuff every time I do one.  I have a long way to go also and will never become a Christophe, lol!  Don''t give up!</td>', 'I think you did a great job Susan.  IMHO, I don''t think the score had anything to do with nudity.  I think it really boils down to strategic voting in the last hours and my score started and ended the same way.  It happens to me all the time.  Use it as a learning tool and go on to the  next.  When you are first learning to mask and do composites, it seems much harder than it will eventually become.  It has been that way for me, and I am still learning new stuff every time I do one.  I have a long way to go also and will never become a Christophe, lol!  Don''t give up!', '2017-01-27 08:37:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7495169, 1193851, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>First of all you''ve done an amazing job here Susan, a great idea. I feel for you it must have been a real pain to process. As far as the nudity is concerned you only had one negative reaction amongst your commenters I think everyone else, me included, appreciated it as a necessary way to approach this very creative idea, the pose works really well. Doesn''t look like we''re gonna be seeing anything of your poor boyfriend in future shots he didn''t fare very well did he, gulp!<br/> <br/>I sense your frustration it must have been disappointing to see it tumble like that especially after all that effort but please try not to let it get to you and continue to amaze us with your great ideas and images.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge First of all you''ve done an amazing job here Susan, a great idea. I feel for you it must have been a real pain to process. As far as the nudity is concerned you only had one negative reaction amongst your commenters I think everyone else, me included, appreciated it as a necessary way to approach this very creative idea, the pose works really well. Doesn''t look like we''re gonna be seeing anything of your poor boyfriend in future shots he didn''t fare very well did he, gulp! I sense your frustration it must have been disappointing to see it tumble like that especially after all that effort but please try not to let it get to you and continue to amaze us with your great ideas and images.', '2017-01-27 12:27:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7495173, 1193842, 56502, '<td valign="top">It certainly would open completely new markets - canned cockroaches and stuff!<br/>Very creative composition!</td>', 'It certainly would open completely new markets - canned cockroaches and stuff!Very creative composition!', '2017-01-27 12:56:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7495175, 1193832, 182284, '<td valign="top">This was a 10 for me. Very nice work</td>', 'This was a 10 for me. Very nice work', '2017-01-27 13:05:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7495178, 1193851, 56502, '<td valign="top">As for the shot, I like it - great idea, great execution.<br/> <br/>As for the nudity, don''t worry about the one comment. Concentrate on the clicks ;-) - I have two shots with woman''s breasts - they are in the top of the list and have more than twice as many views as number 3. Your nude shots are in the top of your list as well. There is appreciation, even if anonymous.<br/> <br/>If nudity is needed for the effect you want to create, then go for it. You did a great job.</td>', 'As for the shot, I like it - great idea, great execution. As for the nudity, don''t worry about the one comment. Concentrate on the clicks ;-) - I have two shots with woman''s breasts - they are in the top of the list and have more than twice as many views as number 3. Your nude shots are in the top of your list as well. There is appreciation, even if anonymous. If nudity is needed for the effect you want to create, then go for it. You did a great job.', '2017-01-27 13:17:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7495194, 1193853, 114969, '<td valign="top">Spectacular indeed. It gives me hiking ideas just by looking at it. Congrats on the ribbon, well deserved!</td>', 'Spectacular indeed. It gives me hiking ideas just by looking at it. Congrats on the ribbon, well deserved!', '2017-01-27 15:05:59.000000', NULL, 0),
