(7495196, 1193832, 114969, '<td valign="top">But of course, this explains a lot! ;) Congrats on the nice finish, I love how elegant Lady Squirrel looks in this outfit :)</td>', 'But of course, this explains a lot! ;) Congrats on the nice finish, I love how elegant Lady Squirrel looks in this outfit :)', '2017-01-27 15:08:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7495198, 1193849, 114969, '<td valign="top">Haha, thanks for the laugh :) For me, it looks like a James Bond parody, would make for a very funny movie opening! Congrats on the nice finish as well.</td>', 'Haha, thanks for the laugh :) For me, it looks like a James Bond parody, would make for a very funny movie opening! Congrats on the nice finish as well.', '2017-01-27 15:10:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7495200, 1193856, 114969, '<td valign="top">I was afraid of blending fur with skin, it looks very difficult to achieve well. But you just did it in a superb way! I am very impressed, this looks great. Congrats on the nice finish!</td>', 'I was afraid of blending fur with skin, it looks very difficult to achieve well. But you just did it in a superb way! I am very impressed, this looks great. Congrats on the nice finish!', '2017-01-27 15:12:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7495201, 1193411, 114969, '<td valign="top">That''s some shrimp recipe I definitely need to read about ;) Great work, I love the composition with the tail, very clever.</td>', 'That''s some shrimp recipe I definitely need to read about ;) Great work, I love the composition with the tail, very clever.', '2017-01-27 15:13:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7495202, 1193851, 114969, '<td valign="top">I love your entry Susan, you definitely did a great work with it: from concept, to shooting, and editing. Regarding negative comments or votes, well, as I often say to myself: everyone has the right to think and say what he wants, but then, you also have the right to totally ignore him and do what you want. Nobody holds the key of Truth, even those claiming everywhere what Art is or isn''t, what a good image is or isn''t. Discard everything, and just keep going exactly how you feel like :) Oh, and congrats on the nice finish!</td>', 'I love your entry Susan, you definitely did a great work with it: from concept, to shooting, and editing. Regarding negative comments or votes, well, as I often say to myself: everyone has the right to think and say what he wants, but then, you also have the right to totally ignore him and do what you want. Nobody holds the key of Truth, even those claiming everywhere what Art is or isn''t, what a good image is or isn''t. Discard everything, and just keep going exactly how you feel like :) Oh, and congrats on the nice finish!', '2017-01-27 15:18:01.000000', NULL, 0),
