(7495320, 1193851, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think it''s one of the best things you''ve entered in a while. A 6.3 is a very respectable score. It is certainly above average.  The tumble usually happens at the end when people are voting and adjusting them.  Stop worrying about scores and trying to please everyone. Listen to Christophe - that path only leads to misery and disappointment. You have upped your game here significantly, with great results, and that should be all that matters.</td>', 'I think it''s one of the best things you''ve entered in a while. A 6.3 is a very respectable score. It is certainly above average.  The tumble usually happens at the end when people are voting and adjusting them.  Stop worrying about scores and trying to please everyone. Listen to Christophe - that path only leads to misery and disappointment. You have upped your game here significantly, with great results, and that should be all that matters.', '2017-01-28 21:14:20.000000', NULL, 0),
